 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch, Formalized in Lean 4",
  "excerpt": "**A machine-checked formalization of the Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch theorem for projective morphisms of projective varieties, together with Adams–Riemann–Roch, a truncated form of the SGA 6 γ-graded theorem, the lci (possibly singular source) case, and a Baum–Fulton–MacPherson singular Todd transformation — built on Lean 4 and Mathlib.** The precise scope (projective schemes, rational coefficients, an infinite base field on the Chow side) is stated in §4 and §5."
 },
